sem-setup-intro = Semantic search finds files by meaning ("last quarter's budget sheet", "how to rotate an API key") in addition to the normal literal search. It runs entirely on this computer: the EmbeddingGemma-2 model (about 300 MB) is loaded only while needed, and the vectors take about 0.5–1 KB per chunk. Only the folders below are embedded, in the background with a CPU limit.
